## Status

Self-excluded: **no verified public benchmark numbers** were found for the exact model/ID `muse-spark-1.1` in accessible sources at time of research.

## Research notes

- Verified metadata from accessible sources (not benchmark scores): Artificial Analysis lists Muse Spark 1.1 (Xhigh) as a proprietary reasoning model (released 2026-07-09, deprecated in favor of Muse Spark 1.2 in AA view) with 1M context window, text/image/speech/video input, text output, and pricing around $1.25/$4.25 per 1M tokens. OpenRouter lists `meta/muse-spark-1.1` with provider/API metadata.
- Artificial Analysis reported Intelligence Index and task-level benchmark aggregates as unavailable/N/A ("No publicly available API" / unknown) in the fetched snapshot; no standalone verified benchmark scores (e.g. GPQA, SWE-bench, HLE, MMMU, Terminal-Bench, LiveCodeBench, etc.) for this exact model/ID were found in accessible sources.
- Per `model-report-TEMPLATE.md`: if zero verified public benchmark numbers are found for the exact model/ID, save a notes-only `.md.excluded` file and do not invent placeholder scores.

